#: source/protocols/binary-cache/nix-cache-info.md:1
msgid "`nix-cache-info` Format"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/nix-cache-info.md:3
msgid ""
"The `nix-cache-info` file is a metadata file at the root of a [binary cache]"
"(../../protocols/binary-cache/index.md) (e.g., `https://cache.example.com/"
"nix-cache-info`)."
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/nix-cache-info.md:5
msgid "MIME type: `text/x-nix-cache-info`"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/nix-cache-info.md:7
msgid "Format"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/nix-cache-info.md:9
msgid "Line-based key-value format:"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/nix-cache-info.md:15
msgid ""
"Leading and trailing whitespace is trimmed from values. Lines without a "
"colon are ignored. Unknown keys are silently ignored."
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/nix-cache-info.md:19
msgid "Fields"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/nix-cache-info.md:21
msgid "`StoreDir`"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/nix-cache-info.md:23
msgid ""
"The Nix store directory path that this cache was built for (e.g., `/nix/"
"store`)."
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/nix-cache-info.md:25
msgid ""
"If present, Nix verifies that this matches the client's store directory:"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/nix-cache-info.md:27
msgid ""
"```\n"
"error: binary cache 'https://example.com' is for Nix stores with prefix '/"
"nix/store', not '/home/user/nix/store'\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/nix-cache-info.md:31
msgid "`WantMassQuery`"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/nix-cache-info.md:33
msgid ""
"`1` or `0`. Sets the default for [`want-mass-query`](../../store/types/http-"
"binary-cache-store.md#store-http-binary-cache-store-want-mass-query)."
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/nix-cache-info.md:35
msgid "`Priority`"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/nix-cache-info.md:37
msgid ""
"Integer. Sets the default for [`priority`](../../store/types/http-binary-"
"cache-store.md#store-http-binary-cache-store-priority)."
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/nix-cache-info.md:39
msgid "Example"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/nix-cache-info.md:47
msgid "Caching Behavior"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/nix-cache-info.md:49
msgid ""
"Nix caches `nix-cache-info` in the [cache directory](../../command-ref/env-"
"common.md#env-NIX_CACHE_HOME) with a 7-day TTL."
msgstr ""

